#43000
A Lush Trail among the Zxyer Trees~
   You are walking along a lush trail through a forest of Zxyer trees,
giants with smooth, silver-green bark and crowns so broad that they meet
overhead like the roof of a great hall.  A thick undergrowth covers the
forest floor like a green quilt.  The sun barely reaches the ground, but
here and there its light breaks through in shifting spears that dance
like spirits, and small creatures play among the roots and search for
food.  To the north the forest grows denser.  To the south, the ancient
archway stands among the trees, its stones strangely blurred, as if seen
through water.
~
