#43001
Deeper among the Zxyer Trees~
   The Zxyer trees crowd closer here, and their silver trunks rise like
the pillars of a temple.  The air is warm and still and smells of green
things growing.  A soft hum fills the forest, so low you feel it more
than hear it, as though the whole wood were quietly singing to itself.
The trail continues north, a mossy hollow opens to the east, and the way
back lies south.
~
