#43002
A Mossy Hollow~
   The ground dips here into a round hollow carpeted with thick, springy
moss of a deep emerald green.  Fallen Zxyer leaves, each as big as a
shield, lie scattered about, and small creatures have made nests beneath
them.  The hollow is warm and sheltered and very quiet.  The trail lies
back to the west.
