#43005
The Valley Floor~
   You stand at the foot of the switchback path, on the floor of the
Valley of Fate.  The air down here is warm and fragrant, and the silence
is broken only by the chuckle of running water somewhere nearby.
Meadows of silver grass stretch away to the north and east, and a
thicket of thorns grows close to the west.  The path climbs back up the
valley side.
