The Singing Brook~
   A clear brook runs here over a bed of round white stones, and the
sound it makes is so like singing that you find yourself listening for
words.  Small silver fish dart in the shallows.  The brook flows on to
the east, where it can be forded, and the valley floor lies to the west.
