#43009
The Golden Orchard~
   Here the Zxyer trees grow smaller and wider, and their branches hang
heavy with round golden fruit that glows faintly in the shade.  The
ground is thick with fallen fruit, and the air is sweet and drowsy with
its scent.  Bees as fat as your thumb drone among the branches.  The
orchard opens onto meadows to the west and south, and to the east lies a
ring of standing stones.
