The Warden's Glade~
   A small glade opens among the Zxyer trees, where a shelter of woven
boughs stands beside a fire pit ringed with stones.  The grass has been
trampled by heavy hooves, and a whetstone and a bundle of arrows lie by
the fire.  Someone keeps watch over the valley from here.  A path leads
north toward the sound of falling water, and the meadow lies to the
south.
