#43011
The Ring of Standing Stones~
   Nine tall gray stones stand in a ring here, each carved with a single
figure: a child, a youth, a lover, a parent, a warrior, an elder, a
mourner, a corpse and, on the last stone, nothing at all.  The grass
inside the ring is short and soft, and no birds sing.  Paths lead north
and west, and the ford lies to the south.
