#43012
The Path of Threads~
   The path here passes beneath Zxyer trees whose lower branches are
hung with threads: thousands upon thousands of them, of every color and
length, drifting and turning gently in the still air.  Some are bright
and new, some faded almost to nothing, some cut short.  They brush
against your face as you walk.  The path leads north, and the ring of
stones lies to the south.
~
