#43015
The Meeting of Three Roads~
   Three roads meet here north of the pool, each paved with a different
stone.  The western road is paved in white, worn and familiar, and an
old sign beside it reads "What Was".  The northern road is paved in gray
and reads "What Is".  The eastern road is paved in black, its stones so
new they might have been laid this morning, and its sign reads "What
Will Be".  The pool lies to the south.
~
