#43022
The Loom of Fate~
   You stand inside the pool, or beneath it, or somewhere beyond it, in
a vast, dim hall with no walls that you can find.  In the middle of it
stands the Loom: a frame of silver-green Zxyer wood so tall that its top
is lost in shadow, strung with more threads than there are stars, and
the cloth it weaves stretches away into the darkness in every direction.
It is weaving now, slowly, with no hands at the shuttle.  High above, a
shimmer of light like the surface of water leads back up to the pool.
~
