#43024
The Fallen Zxyer~
   A Zxyer tree of enormous size has fallen here across the valley
floor, its roots torn out of the earth in a great wall of soil and stone
taller than a house.  Its trunk, hollow with age, lies like a tunnel
along the ground, and something large has been going in and out of it,
judging by the trampled earth and the scratches on the bark.  The ford
lies to the north, and an opening in the hollow trunk leads in.
~
